A short update from my side: I made the change from the review thread below. Commit 74fc2ed301 removes the dispatch test file, so the PR now changes only `python/sglang/srt/utils/triton_load_watch.py`.

With that file gone, no test on `intel_dev` covers the new accelerator path. The existing `test_triton_load_watch.py` is CUDA-only. I updated the PR body to match.

@jianan-gu, could you review the PR again when you have a moment? If nothing else is open, please approve.

